            description: 'A UNESCO World Heritage city built on seven hills in northern Bavaria — an extraordinarily well-preserved medieval townscape with a thousand-year-old cathedral, a town hall perched on a bridge, an island neighbourhood called "Little Venice", and a unique smoked beer (Rauchbier) tradition found nowhere else on Earth.',
